{"id": "d9ebcad4-5e98-4843-9bbf-7ee2ae741e87", "slug": "nova-os-landing-page-1", "title": "Nova OS Landing Page", "description": "Nova Elevate Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nova OS Landing Page\"\ndescription: \"Nova Elevate Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#8B8B8F\"\n  surface: \"#38383A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#38383A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Instrument Serif\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"18px\"\n  control: \"17px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nova OS Landing Page\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 99; favorites: 10; remixes: 2.\nTags: testimonial, section, animated, bento, social-proof.\n## Overview\nNova Elevate Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNova OS Elevate strategy. Drive results. 08:00 - 09:00 Remote Quarterly Review 09:00 - 09:30 Remote J S Design Sync 10:00 - 11:00 Remote A B C Annual Strategy Alignment Sync your workflow Integrate your tools to automat…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Elevate strategy. Drive results.; Quarterly Review; Design Sync; Annual Strategy Alignment; Sync your workflow.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #000000, accent #FFFFFF, background #8B8B8F, surface #38383A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Instrument Serif for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nova OS Landing Page</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#8b8b8f] text-white overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-white/20 h-full min-h-screen relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full -z-20 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Simulated Framing Silhouettes (Left) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-1/4 h-full -z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 50%, rgba(20,20,22,0.8) 0%, rgba(20,20,22,0) 70%); mix-blend-mode: multiply;\"></div>\n    <svg class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-[30vw] h-full -z-10 text-[#1a1a1c] fill-current opacity-90 pointer-events-none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n        <path d=\"M0,0 L20,0 L15,15 L25,30 L10,50 L30,70 L15,85 L20,100 L0,100 Z\" style=\"filter: blur(2px);\"></path>\n    </svg>\n\n    <!-- Simulated Framing Silhouettes (Right) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 right-0 w-1/4 h-full -z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 50%, rgba(20,20,22,0.8) 0%, rgba(20,20,22,0) 70%); mix-blend-mode: multiply;\"></div>\n    <svg class=\"fixed top-0 right-0 w-[25vw] h-full -z-10 text-[#151517] fill-current opacity-90 pointer-events-none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n        <path d=\"M100,0 L80,0 L85,20 L75,40 L90,60 L70,80 L85,100 L100,100 Z\" style=\"filter: blur(2px);\"></path>\n    </svg>\n\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"absolute top-8 w-full flex justify-center items-center gap-2 z-20 text-[#e4e4e5]\">\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sun-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n        <span class=\"text-lg tracking-tight font-normal\">Nova OS</span>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Background Serif Text -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center -z-10 pointer-events-none px-4\">\n        <h1 id=\"reveal-text\" class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl text-[#e4e4e5]/90 tracking-tight text-center leading-tight whitespace-nowrap\" style=\"font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;\">\n            Elevate strategy.<br>Drive results.\n        </h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Center UI Components -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full max-w-sm px-4 mt-12 mb-20 gap-3\">\n\n        <!-- Faded Card 1: Past Event -->\n        <div class=\"w-full rounded-[18px] relative group opacity-30 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"w-full rounded-[17px] p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #38383a 0%, #2b2b2d 100%);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[#a1a1a3]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span>08:00 - 09:00 Remote</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm text-[#e4e4e5] tracking-tight font-medium\">Quarterly Review</h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Faded Card 2: Past Event -->\n        <div class=\"w-full rounded-[18px] relative group opacity-60 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"w-full rounded-[17px] p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #38383a 0%, #2b2b2d 100%);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[#a1a1a3]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span>09:00 - 09:30 Remote</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Avatars -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center -space-x-1.5\">\n                        <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#5a5a5c] border border-[#38383a] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/50\">J</div>\n                        <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#4a4a4c] border border-[#38383a] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/50\">S</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm text-[#e4e4e5] tracking-tight font-medium\">Design Sync</h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Top Card: Event Details -->\n        <div class=\"w-full rounded-[18px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"w-full rounded-[17px] p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #38383a 0%, #2b2b2d 100%);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[#a1a1a3]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span>10:00 - 11:00 Remote</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Avatars -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center -space-x-1.5\">\n                        <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#5a5a5c] border border-[#38383a] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/50\">A</div>\n                        <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#4a4a4c] border border-[#38383a] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/50\">B</div>\n                        <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#6a6a6c] border border-[#38383a] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/50\">C</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm text-[#e4e4e5] tracking-tight font-medium\">Annual Strategy Alignment</h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Card: Connection Prompt -->\n        <div class=\"w-full rounded-[18px] relative\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"w-full rounded-[17px] p-5 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-5 backdrop-blur-2xl relative overflow-hidden\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #323234 0%, #252527 100%);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-sm text-[#e4e4e5] tracking-tight font-medium\">Sync your workflow</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-[#959597] font-normal leading-relaxed pr-4\">\n                        Integrate your tools to automate tasks and never miss an update.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 mt-2\">\n                    <!-- Primary Button -->\n                    <button class=\"w-full rounded-xl py-2.5 px-4 text-xs font-medium text-[#111111] transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98] flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"\n                            style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #e5e5e5 100%);\n                                   box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:google-icon\" class=\"text-[14px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Authenticate with Google\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Secondary Button -->\n                    <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center text-xs font-normal text-[#959597] hover:text-[#e4e4e5] transition-colors py-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:microsoft-outlook\" class=\"text-[14px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Authenticate with Outlook\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"absolute bottom-8 w-full flex justify-center z-20\">\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#a1a1a3]/80 text-center max-w-lg px-6 font-normal leading-relaxed\">\n            The premier operating system for enterprise. Automate workflows, compliance, and<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"> data intelligence to scale operations seamlessly.\n        </p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Animations -->\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background Details (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 50;\n\n            // Renderer\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Particles\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 700;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 150; // Spread over larger area\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n            // Generate a radial gradient texture for glowy rounded particles\n            const canvasTexture = document.createElement('canvas');\n            canvasTexture.width = 64;\n            canvasTexture.height = 64;\n            const ctx = canvasTexture.getContext('2d');\n            const gradient = ctx.createRadialGradient(32, 32, 0, 32, 32, 32);\n            gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,1)');\n            gradient.addColorStop(0.2, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)');\n            gradient.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.2)');\n            gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');\n            ctx.fillStyle = gradient;\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 64, 64);\n            const texture = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvasTexture);\n\n            // Custom Shader Material for rounded, soft glowing particles\n            const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.8,\n                color: 0xffffff,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                map: texture,\n                depthWrite: false, // Essential for glow blending\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Gentle rotation\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.01;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Resize handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const textElement = document.getElementById('reveal-text');\n            // Simple word splitter since we can't use SplitText plugin\n            const words = textElement.innerHTML.split('<br>');\n            textElement.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach((lineText, lineIndex) => {\n                const lineDiv = document.createElement('div');\n                // Ensure inline-block for transform, overflow-hidden for mask\n                lineDiv.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                lineDiv.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                lineDiv.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n\n                if (lineIndex > 0) {\n                     textElement.appendChild(document.createElement('br'));\n                }\n\n                const lineWords = lineText.trim().split(' ');\n                lineWords.forEach((wordText, wordIndex) => {\n                    const wordWrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordWrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wordWrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wordWrapper.style.paddingRight = '0.2em'; // space between words\n\n                    const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    innerSpan.classList.add('reveal-word');\n                    innerSpan.innerHTML = wordText;\n\n                    wordWrapper.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                    lineDiv.appendChild(wordWrapper);\n                });\n\n                textElement.appendChild(lineDiv);\n            });\n\n            // Animate\n            gsap.fromTo('.reveal-word',\n                {\n                    y: '100%',\n                    opacity: 0,\n                    rotationZ: 2\n                },\n                {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    rotationZ: 0,\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    stagger: 0.1,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: 'body',\n                        start: 'top top',\n                        // Triggers immediately on load, acts as entry animation\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n\n            // Subtle float animation for the center UI\n            gsap.to('main', {\n                y: -10,\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize scripts\n        window.onload = () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n        };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nova-os-landing-page-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nova-os-landing-page-1.jpg", "source_name": "nova-os-landing-page-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 289, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T08:31:02.822136+00:00"}